  32:Drivers/lvgl/src/draw/../../include/lvgl/core/../font/../draw/../stdlib/lv_string.h ****  * @brief Copies a block of memory from a source address to a destination address.
  33:Drivers/lvgl/src/draw/../../include/lvgl/core/../font/../draw/../stdlib/lv_string.h ****  * @param dst Pointer to the destination array where the content is to be copied.
