  42:Drivers/lvgl/src/draw/../../include/lvgl/core/../font/../draw/../stdlib/lv_string.h ****  * @brief Fills a block of memory with a specified value.
  43:Drivers/lvgl/src/draw/../../include/lvgl/core/../font/../draw/../stdlib/lv_string.h ****  * @param dst Pointer to the destination array to fill with the specified value.
