  45:Drivers/lvgl/src/draw/../../include/lvgl/core/../font/../draw/../stdlib/lv_string.h ****  *          the block of memory using the unsigned char conversion of this value.
  46:Drivers/lvgl/src/draw/../../include/lvgl/core/../font/../draw/../stdlib/lv_string.h ****  * @param len Number of bytes to be set to the value.
